<div class="booking-card">
  <h3>Book your appointment securely</h3>
  <p class="booking-card__intro">We schedule and complete intake through <strong>Osmind</strong>, our secure, HIPAA-compliant patient platform, so your personal and health information goes straight into a protected system.</p>

  <div class="booking-option">
    <div class="booking-option__text">
      <strong>Francis Agbotse, PMHNP</strong>
      <span>Aetna, Ambetter, Medicare &amp; Medicaid</span>
    </div>
    <a href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Book with Francis (opens our secure Osmind scheduling page in a new tab)">Book with Francis <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  </div>

  <div class="booking-option">
    <div class="booking-option__text">
      <strong>Dr. Badeea Qureshi, MD</strong>
      <span>Private pay · sliding scale available</span>
    </div>
    {% if site.qureshiBookingUrl %}<a href="{{ site.qureshiBookingUrl }}" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Book with Dr. Qureshi (opens our secure Osmind scheduling page in a new tab)">Book with Dr. Qureshi</a>{% elif site.inquiryFormUrl %}<a href="{{ site.inquiryFormUrl }}" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Request an appointment with Dr. Qureshi (opens our secure request form in a new tab)">Request an appointment</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}" class="btn btn--outline"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i> Call or text to schedule</a>{% endif %}
  </div>

  {%- if site.inquiryFormUrl %}
  <p class="booking-card__help">Not sure which provider is right for you, or prefer not to call? <a href="{{ site.inquiryFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fill out our secure request form</a> or call or text <a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>, and our care coordinator will reach out.</p>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="booking-card__help">Not sure which provider is right for you? Call or text <a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> and our care coordinator will help you get started.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p class="booking-card__help">Already a patient? <a href="{{ site.portalUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Log in to the patient portal</a> to message your provider.</p>

  <p class="privacy-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span><strong>Your privacy matters.</strong> Please don't send medical details by email or text. Your health history is collected securely during intake in Osmind.</span></p>
</div>
